; Freelancer Decomp: a reimplementation of the Freelancer (2003) game client and engine,
; faithful to the behaviour of the original game.
; This file was reconstructed by reverse engineering the binaries of Freelancer 1.1,
; developed by Digital Anvil.
; Author: Giperion.
;
; x64 build (docs/x64.md): Content.def with the C++ names decorated for x64. Keep the two in
; step.

LIBRARY Content
EXPORTS
    ??0IDLL@@QEAA@AEBU0@@Z @1
    ??0IDLL@@QEAA@XZ @2
    ??1IDLL@@UEAA@XZ @3
    ??4IDLL@@QEAAAEAU0@AEBU0@@Z @4
    ??_7IDLL@@6B@ @5 DATA
    CreateInstance @6
    DestroyInstance @7
